    "source": {
      "value": "lome"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "### Description\nYour natural form's fangs are capable of injecting foes with venom. You gain the Anadi Venom ability.\n\n**Anadi Venom**\nActivate (1 Action)\nFrequency: a number of times per day equal to your level\nYou envenom your fangs. If the next fangs Strike you make before the end of your turn hits and deals damage, the Strike deals an additional 1d6 poison damage. On a critical failure, the poison is wasted as normal. At 12th level, this poison damage increases to 2d6."
    },
